---
import { SITE, KEY_INFO } from '@/consts';
---

<footer class="relative mt-auto bg-ocean text-sand">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-3">
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <img src="/favicon.svg" alt="" width="44" height="44" class="rounded-lg" />
          <span class="font-display text-2xl font-bold">{SITE.name}</span>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-4 max-w-sm text-sand/80">
          {SITE.description}
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold">Hubungi / Alamat</h3>
        <address class="mt-4 not-italic text-sand/80">
          {KEY_INFO[0].value}<br />
          George Town, Pulau Pinang<br />
          Malaysia
        </address>
        <a
          href={SITE.mapsUrl}
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="mt-4 inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-medium text-lantern-300 hover:text-white"
        >
          Lihat di Google Maps
          <svg class="h-4 w-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M10 6H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2v-4M14 4h6m0 0v6m0-6L10 14" />
          </svg>
        </a>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold">Pautan Pantas</h3>
        <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-sand/80">
          <li><a href="#info-penting" class="hover:text-white">Info Penting</a></li>
          <li><a href="#makanan" class="hover:text-white">Makanan</a></li>
          <li><a href="#pengangkutan" class="hover:text-white">Pengangkutan</a></li>
          <li><a href="#galeri" class="hover:text-white">Galeri</a></li>
          <li><a href="#faq" class="hover:text-white">Soalan Lazim</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 border-t border-white/10 pt-6 text-sm text-sand/70">
      <p class="mb-2">
        Penafian: Laman web ini bukan laman web rasmi Chew Jetty. Ia disediakan sebagai pandungan pelancong bebas. Maklumat tertakluk kepada perubahan; sila sahkan terus dengan pihak berkuasa tempatan atau Google Maps sebelum melawat.
      </p>
      <p>&copy; {new Date().getFullYear()} {SITE.name}. Hak cipta terpelihara.</p>
      <p class="mt-2">
        <a href="/privacy-policy" class="underline decoration-white/40 underline-offset-4 hover:text-white">Dasar Privasi &amp; Kuki</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
